#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:5
#: ea330c5f2bed46d0a9987871580f6766
msgid "ArduPilot Discord Server"
msgstr "ArduPilot Discord 服务器"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:7
#: 90d31639a5914912baf32148b8eb0ea1
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot dev team uses `Discord <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ for "
"real-time voice chat.  We have a \"General Discussion\" channel for chatting"
" about ArduPilot development at any time. How many developers are connected "
"depends a lot on timezones.  Don't be shy about your English language "
"ability, we have developers from all over the world."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 开发团队使用 `Discord <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ 进行实时语音聊天。我们有一个 "
"「General Discussion」 频道，可随时就 ArduPilot "
"开发进行交流。在线开发者数量在很大程度上取决于时区。不要因英语能力而感到羞怯，我们有来自世界各地的开发者。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:11
#: 9cdd2319acd047fd94fdc6b35c182347
msgid ""
"The channel is for development discussions only. Please don't use it as a "
"user help channel. We don't record the calls, and we would ask you not to "
"record them yourself."
msgstr "该频道仅用于开发讨论，请勿用于用户帮助。我们不录制通话，也请您不要自行录制。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:15
#: ccfd343068d84bb2930b150b20331d89
msgid "Installing and Connecting"
msgstr "安装与连接"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:17
#: dad721d686e849e6ba678346b66314ad
msgid ""
"Discord is available both as a web and installed application.  Use the "
"provided link in the first instance."
msgstr "Discord 提供网页版和安装版。建议首先使用提供的链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:19
#: 4b317a2973ad4be0b801d6bb83eb8cb5
msgid ""
"When you first join the server it will ask you to choose a username. Please "
"choose something like *FirstnameLastname*."
msgstr "首次加入服务器时会要求选择用户名。请选择类似 *名字姓氏* 的格式。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:22
#: 38c3565c21464cc8b9dec8090c89802c
msgid "Weekly dev calls"
msgstr "每周开发者会议"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:24
#: 92a33d34c66c406ca382cb0525b13eb4
msgid ""
"The weekly development call is held on Discord in the \"Weekly Dev Call\" "
"channel.  The agenda and minutes are normally sent to discuss.ardupilot.org."
" Time of the meeting is: 2300 UTC each Monday."
msgstr ""
"每周开发者会议在 Discord 的 「Weekly Dev Call」 频道举行。议程和会议纪要通常发布至 "
"discuss.ardupilot.org。会议时间：每周一 UTC 23:00。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:27
#: f997e929738a4fd4b4640652de354e52
msgid ""
"A second development call is held at a time more convenient for the European"
" community. This meeting is held each Wednesday at 0700 UTC."
msgstr "另有一场面向欧洲社区的开发者会议，在更方便的时间举行，每周三 UTC 07:00 召开。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:30
#: 1dafa4aaeaa044c4ab9f1821491b6ed9
#, fuzzy, no-python-format
msgid ""
"A calendar with the meetings can be found `here "
"<https://calendar.google.com/calendar/embed?src=rgdbom27tb1vlo62kjjnmt8va4%40group.calendar.google.com>`__."
" This is also available in ICS format `here "
"<https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/rgdbom27tb1vlo62kjjnmt8va4%40group.calendar.google.com/public/basic.ics>`__,"
" for integration with other calendar clients. Depending on the browser, "
"times may be displayed in local time, or GMT and is so noted if in GMT"
msgstr ""
"会议日历可在 "
"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/embed?src=rgdbom27tb1vlo62kjjnmt8va4%40group.calendar.google.com"
" 查看。根据浏览器不同，时间可能显示为本地时间或 GMT，如为 GMT 则会注明。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:34
#: 98435daf4f5042948f69b87e560cc895
msgid "Prefer Typing?"
msgstr "偏好文字聊天？"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-discord-server.rst:36
#: 2e53950992b642bc82b56e1d125e6d90
msgid ""
"If you prefer text chat, please join us on `Discord "
"<https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__"
msgstr "如果您偏好文字聊天，请加入我们的 `Discord <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__"
